  "description": "While collecting a debt, a mage's blunder shrinks Hermi to just inches tall! To fund the cure, the mage scams the handsome Marquis Frey Ozette, a man obsessed with curios, by selling her to him as a rare fairy. Will Hermi ever regain her true size, or will she become Frey's most prized possession?\n\n(Source: Manta)\n\n*Note: Includes five extra chapters.*",
